    "detailed_description": "Renamer is a graphical file renaming utility which makes the renaming of thousands of files both simple and convenient.<br><br>The workflow is simple:<br><br>1) Import your files, one-by-one or by folder<br>2) Add and configure renaming rules, which are easy to understand yet powerful<br>3) Save your renamed files to an output location, or rename them in place<br><br>Renamer also features the ability to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Save and load renaming rule presets<br></li><li> Easily revert your changes<br></li><li> Preview your changes before any saving is done</li></ul> <br>If you work with a large number of files, let Renamer help you manage and simplify your workflow.",
